Hanuman shows Rama inscribed ring and bids grief end --- Sita rejoices like moon freed from Rahu and praises Hanuman --- Sita praises ocean leap and asks why Rama delays burning earth --- Sita asks if Rama grieves acts seeks allies and stays faithful --- Sita asks after Kausalya Sumitra Bharata Sugriva Lakshmana rescue --- Hanuman swears Rama ignorant but coming with monkey bear army --- Hanuman swears by mountains Sita will see moon-faced Rama --- Hanuman tells sleepless fasting Rama chants Sita and strives for her
